{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488620/extras/008b926a5accd74557589df00195460c.avif?t=1762767040\" width=920 height=301 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>P</strong>repare to unleash your inner avian fury in <strong>Birdoo</strong>, an exhilarating indie action game that casts you as a feathered avenger. Tired of the indignities, the shooing, and being dismissed as a mere &quot;flying rat,&quot; you embark on a relentless quest for payback against humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into diverse and vibrant levels, each offering a unique battleground for your revenge. Your mission is simple yet challenging: defeat as many enemies as possible before the clock runs out. Every vanquished foe contributes to your score, propelling you closer to advancing to the next stage. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488620/extras/3b34c5f08f2ae5193337bafdffae1900.webp?t=1762767040\" width=920 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through a <strong>dozen varied stages</strong>, each presenting you with distinct challenges. From bustling cityscapes, tranquil hiking paths, all the way to outer space every level demands a fresh approach to your aerial assault.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488620/extras/4ee243bf4084d2bab57172bb4977d890.webp?t=1762767040\" width=920 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the <strong>Challenge Mode.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attempt unique challenges like saving as many humans as possible before the time runs out, surviving a relentless onslaught of atacks for as long as possible, collecting as many flies as you can within the time limit while having tiny wings and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488620/extras/71bd305fa174a980d2997026f7e127d7.webp?t=1762767040\" width=920 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your points aren't just for bragging rights. Use them to <strong>unlock </strong>new power ups<strong>\u00a0</strong>enhancing your bird's capabilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488620/extras/8dc1dc40b70c1eeda16345b555c977db.webp?t=1762767040\" width=920 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab an arsenal of <strong>power-ups</strong> throughout the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab secret <strong>game modifiers</strong> - catch enough flies to spawn a modifier. You never know what you'll get. Your enemies could freeze with fear or your wings could shrink causing every flap to be a fight against gravity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488620/extras/b696effc60be6e9067831df8fe116907.poster.avif?t=1762767040\" width=784 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488620/extras/b696effc60be6e9067831df8fe116907.webm?t=1762767040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect</strong> weapon power-ups to unleash devastating attacks, enhance your speed, or gain temporary invincibility to amplify your path of destruction.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488620/extras/2d73fc5449feaa9ab955ff19817e4883.poster.avif?t=1762767040\" width=784 height=92 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488620/extras/2d73fc5449feaa9ab955ff19817e4883.webm?t=1762767040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488620/extras/25ed75b163de7a48eefa805ad088b3ab.webp?t=1762767040\" width=920 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to face a <strong>diverse cast of adversaries</strong>, with unique behaviors and vulnerabilities. From the unsuspecting pedestrian to the aggressive exterminator.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488620/extras/972081b7f9ac6fe3f6fb9544bad6bdfc.webp?t=1762767040\" width=920 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and choose the type of pigeon you want to be and <strong>customise</strong> your winged menace with a variety of outfits.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488620/extras/94ddd56a0f9032452883d54633a89188.webp?t=1762767040\" width=920 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against for the highest score<strong>\u00a0</strong>to assert your aerial supremacy. With every successful stage and high score, climb the <strong>leaderboard</strong> and prove that you are the ultimate feathered menace. Show humanity, and your fellow birds, who truly is the boss.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enough with being called a \u201cflying rat\u201d and shooed away! It\u2019s payback time! Soar with grace, strike with fury, and show your enemies who the boss is.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a formidable <strong>feathe